System.out.println(max);', '["6", "4", "True", "10"]'::jsonb, 0, 'A > b (6 > 4) is true, so the ternary expression evaluates to a, which is 6.', 'Control Structures', false, 'first', 2),
  ('cos-201-java-programming', 'COS 201: Computer Programming I (Java)', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Agriculture', 'Computer Science', '200 Level', 'What is the output of the following code?
int a = 3, b = 9;
int max = (a > b)? a: b;
System.out.println(max);', '["3", "9", "False", "12"]'::jsonb, 1, 'A > b (3 > 9) is false, so the ternary expression evaluates to its second operand, b, which is 9.', 'Control Structures', false, 'first', 2),
  ('cos-201-java-programming', 'COS 201: Computer Programming I (Java)', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Agriculture', 'Computer Science', '200 Level', 'What is the output of the following code?
int i = 1;
