  ('cos-201-java-programming', 'COS 201: Computer Programming I (Java)', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Agriculture', 'Computer Science', '200 Level', 'What is the value of `x` after this code runs?
